erence between the diode and the transistor.<br><br>Play and relax with the benefit of the mind!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293700/extras/ec38cacb361d6af63155f2f054db0cd6.poster.avif?t=1632940598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293700/extras/ec38cacb361d6af63155f2f054db0cd6.webm?t=1632940598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293700/extras/ec38cacb361d6af63155f2f054db0cd6.mp4?t=1632940598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Electronic maze<br></li><li>Puzzles that make your brains work at full power!<br></li><li>Over 20 different elements of electronic circuits in the most simplified and complex combinations<br></li><li>Over 100 intuitive levels with a gradual increase in difficulty</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293700/extras/edda02bf4fd47b42bdbaee61e0cb61cc.poster.avif?t=1632940598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293700/extras/edda02bf4fd47b42bdbaee61e0cb61cc.webm?t=1632940598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293700/extras/edda02bf4fd47b42bdbaee61e0cb61cc.mp4?t=1632940598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
